#: warehouse/templates/includes/file-details.html:117
msgid "Uploaded via"
msgstr "Uppladdad via"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/file-details.html:127
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Ursprung"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/file-details.html:130
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Provenance</strong> describes where a file came from. On PyPI, "
"provenance is shared via <strong>attestations</strong>, which provide a "
"verifiable record of the build or publishing details. <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">View details, limitations and caveats.</a>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ursprung</strong> beskriver varifrån en fil kommer. På PyPI delas "
"ursprungsinformation genom <strong>attesteringar</strong>, som ger ett "
"verifierbart register över bygge eller publiceringsdetaljer. <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">Visa detaljer, begränsningar och förbehåll.</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/manage-project-button.html:5
msgid "Manage project"
msgstr "Hantera projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/session-notifications.html:12
#, python-format
msgid "Your primary email address (%(email_address)s) is unverified."
msgstr "Din primära e-postadress, %(email_address)s, är inte verifierad."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/session-notifications.html:14
msgid "You do not have a primary email address."
msgstr "Du har ingen primär e-postadress."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/session-notifications.html:17
msgid "Verify your email or add a new address."
msgstr "Verifiera e-postadressen eller lägg till en ny adress."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/session-notifications.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Two factor authentication is available, <a href=\"%(href)s\">enable it now "
"for your account.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Tvåfaktorsautentisering är tillgänglig. <a href=\"%(href)s\">Aktivera den nu"
" för ditt konto.</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/session-notifications.html:46
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Two-factor recovery codes are available, <a href=\"%(href)s\">generate them "
"now for your account.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Återställningskoder för tvåfaktorsautentisering är tillgängliga. <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">Skapa dem nu för ditt konto.</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/accounts/profile-callout.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have not uploaded any projects to PyPI, yet. To learn how to get "
"started, visit the <a href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Packaging User Guide</a>"
msgstr ""
"Du har ännu inte laddat upp några projekt till PyPI. Läs <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Python Packaging User Guide</a> för att komma i gång"

#: warehouse/templates/includes/accounts/profile-callout.html:11
#, python-format
msgid "%(username)s has not uploaded any projects to PyPI, yet."
msgstr "%(username)s har ännu inte laddat upp några projekt till PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/manage/company-org-survey-callout.html:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Some companies need a formal agreement with PyPI covering support, "
"availability, or compliance requirements. We are gathering interest to "
"understand what companies need. Learn more about <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">organization accounts</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vissa företag behöver ett formellt avtal med PyPI om support, tillgänglighet"
" eller efterlevnadskrav. Vi samlar in intresseanmälningar för att förstå "
"företagens behov. Läs mer om <a href=\"%(href)s\">organisationskonton</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/manage/company-org-survey-callout.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Tell us what you need by filling out the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PyPI Service "
"Agreement Interest</a> survey and we'll follow up."
msgstr ""
"Berätta vad du behöver genom att fylla i enkäten <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PyPI Service "
"Agreement Interest</a>, så återkommer vi."

#: warehouse/templates/includes/manage/company-org-survey-callout.html:23
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are seeing this because you belong to the company organization %(orgs)s."
msgid_plural ""
"You are seeing this because you belong to these company organizations: "
"%(orgs)s."
msgstr[0] "Du ser detta eftersom du tillhör företagsorganisationen %(orgs)s."
msgstr[1] ""
"Du ser detta eftersom du tillhör företagsorganisationerna %(orgs)s."

